ja:
余ベクトルは逆ヤコビ行列で変換する： $W'_m(y)
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}W_n(x).$ スカラーの勾配が標準的な例である。連鎖律を [eq:scalar-law] に適用すると、 $\frac{\partial S}{\partial y^m}
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}
  \frac{\partial S}{\partial x^n}.$

zh:
余矢量按逆雅可比变换： $W'_m(y)
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}W_n(x).$ 标量的梯度是标准例子。对 [eq:scalar-law] 应用链式法则， $\frac{\partial S}{\partial y^m}
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}
  \frac{\partial S}{\partial x^n}.$

fr:
Un covecteur se transforme avec le jacobien inverse : $W'_m(y)
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}W_n(x).$ Le gradient d’un scalaire en est l’exemple standard. En appliquant la règle de dérivation en chaîne à [eq:scalar-law], $\frac{\partial S}{\partial y^m}
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}
  \frac{\partial S}{\partial x^n}.$

es:
Un covector se transforma con el jacobiano inverso: $W'_m(y)
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}W_n(x).$ El gradiente de un escalar es el ejemplo estándar. Al aplicar la regla de la cadena a [eq:scalar-law], $\frac{\partial S}{\partial y^m}
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}
  \frac{\partial S}{\partial x^n}.$

de:
Ein Kovektor transformiert sich mit der inversen Jacobi-Matrix: $W'_m(y)
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}W_n(x).$ Der Gradient eines Skalars ist das Standardbeispiel. Wenden wir die Kettenregel auf [eq:scalar-law] an, so folgt $\frac{\partial S}{\partial y^m}
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}
  \frac{\partial S}{\partial x^n}.$

zh-Hant:
餘向量依逆雅可比變換： $W'_m(y)
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}W_n(x).$ 標量的梯度是標準例子。將鏈鎖律應用於 [eq:scalar-law]，可得 $\frac{\partial S}{\partial y^m}
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}
  \frac{\partial S}{\partial x^n}.$

ko:
쌍대벡터는 역야코비 행렬에 따라 변환한다. $W'_m(y)
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}W_n(x).$ 스칼라의 기울기가 대표적인 예다. [eq:scalar-law]에 연쇄법칙을 적용하면 $\frac{\partial S}{\partial y^m}
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}
  \frac{\partial S}{\partial x^n}.$

vi:
Một đồng vectơ biến đổi theo Jacobian nghịch đảo: $W'_m(y)
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}W_n(x).$ Gradient của một vô hướng là ví dụ chuẩn. Áp dụng quy tắc dây chuyền cho [eq:scalar-law], $\frac{\partial S}{\partial y^m}
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}
  \frac{\partial S}{\partial x^n}.$

ru:
Ковектор преобразуется с помощью обратного якобиана: $W'_m(y)
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}W_n(x).$ Градиент скаляра — стандартный пример. Применяя правило цепочки к [eq:scalar-law], $\frac{\partial S}{\partial y^m}
 =\frac{\partial x^n}{\partial y^m}
  \frac{\partial S}{\partial x^n}.$

